Version: 1.1
desc: Herd Mentality Synthesizer (Calf Monosynth port) by chmaha
tags: instrument synthesizer monophonic polyphonic subtractive virtual-analog bass lead
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Add full copyright and licence header (upstream authors' notices).
about:
  A synthesizer with two wavetable oscillators (16 waveforms each), eight filter types, two envelopes,
  two LFOs and a ten-slot modulation matrix.
  Mono mode is Calf Monosynth exactly. Poly mode (an addition) plays up to 8 voices, each a full copy of the
  mono voice; the oldest released note is stolen first, Free LFOs stay in step across voices, and portamento
  glides from the last note played. The sustain pedal (CC64) works in both modes.
  Osc1 has Stretch (a hard-sync sweep) and Window; Osc2 has an eight-voice Unison. Both have pulse width.
  Portamento and four legato modes, velocity to filter and amplitude, mod wheel, channel pressure and pitch bend.
  Includes Calf's 21 factory presets.
  Ported from Calf Monosynth by Krzysztof Foltman (Calf Studio Gear, https://calf-studio-gear.org), GNU LGPL 2.1+.
  Styled after calfNXT by Markus Schmidt (https://calfnxt.org).
  JSFX version released under GPLv3 license
  Claude generated some of this code
